        base-R subassignment, the latter being several hundred times slower on large
        models (follow-up to pull request #27).
      * R/load.first: .onAttach no longer derives the library location from system.file(),
        which searches .libPaths() rather than the library the package was loaded from;
        it now uses the libname R passes to the hook, and no longer aborts when the
        package description cannot be found (issue #25).
      * NAMESPACE: import sparseMatrix from Matrix.

